{"suttaId":"ja110","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ja-i","vriCode":"s0513m.mul","paras":[615,622],"vripara":"110"},"segments":{"ja110:0.4":"Sabbasaṃhārakapañhajātakaṃ","ja110:1.1":"Sabbasaṃhārako [sabbasāhārako (ka.)] natthi, suddhaṃ kaṅgu pavāyati;","ja110:1.3":"Alikaṃ bhāyatiyaṃ dhuttī, saccamāha mahallikāti.","ja110:2.1":"Sabbasaṃhārakapañhajātakaṃ dasamaṃ.","ja110:2.2":"Parosatavaggo ekādasamo.","ja110:3.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","ja110:4.1":"Saparosata tāyita verī puna, bhamacakkatha nāgasirivhayano;","ja110:4.3":"Sukhakañca vata sippaka bāhiyā, kuṇḍapūva mahallikakā ca dasāti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
